Developer Portfolios feed sync <%= @result.success? ? "succeeded" : "FAILED" %>

<% if @result.success? -%>
Entries in feed: <%= @result.total %>
Created:         <%= @result.created.size %>
Updated:         <%= @result.updated.size %>
Deactivated:     <%= @result.deactivated.size %>
Skipped invalid: <%= @result.skipped.size %>
<% else -%>
Error: <%= @result.error %>
<% end -%>

<% if @result.created.any? -%>

New portfolios:
<% @result.created.each do |name| -%>
  - <%= name %>
<% end -%>
<% end -%>

<% if @result.skipped.any? -%>

Skipped invalid entries (need attention in the upstream feed):
<% @result.skipped.each do |entry| -%>
  - <%= entry[:name] %> (<%= entry[:url] %>): <%= entry[:error] %>
<% end -%>
<% end -%>

<% if @result.deactivated.any? -%>

Deactivated (no longer in the feed):
<% @result.deactivated.each do |name| -%>
  - <%= name %>
<% end -%>
<% end -%>